          "_name": "article21",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article021\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ff8f7a\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#550000\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img-395-646x431.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#550000\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                        <b>Join our community</b>\n                    </h5>\n                    <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The Zoom in Film Festival (ZIFF) is more than an event; it is a movement that synthesizes youth-led creative initiative with professional heritage conservation. We are looking for passionate individuals to join our mission of bridging the distance between the cinema screen and the ancient stones of Roșia Montană.\n<div>By joining our team, you become part of a sophisticated philanthropic ecosystem dedicated to the \"Adopt a House\" program and the preservation of over 2,000 years of history<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">.</span></div></h6>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            Learn more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li><b>1. Festival Operations Team (Bucharest)<br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br>Help us bring the \"Zoom In\" philosophy to life in the city. We are looking for team members to support our 2027 Summer Summit in authentic and inspiring cinema locations across Bucharest.<br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br>Media &amp; Communications: Manage our digital presence and translate the \"dust and stones\" of heritage into compelling narratives for a global audience</b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">.<br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br>Event Coordination: Support venue management, guest relations, and the logistics of our curated film screenings.<br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br>Categories &amp; Curation: Assist in shaping our \"engaged cinema\" program, focusing on fiction, documentary, and animated films that capture the pulse of a new generation</b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">.</b></li><li><b>2. Heritage Field Team (Summer Campaigns)<br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">For those who want to move beyond the lens, our Summer Volunteer Campaigns in Roșia Montană offer a unique \"curriculum in heritage responsibility\"</b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">. This is your chance to engage in the scientific endeavor of restoration alongside expert craftsmen</b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">.<br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br>Hands-on Restoration: Apply traditional crafts, such as lime-sand plastering, stone masonry, and the manufacture of wooden shingles</b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">.<br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br>Community Immersion: Live within the very heritage structures you are saving—such as the historic Unitarian Parish House—and participate in a transformative 12-day residency</b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">.</b></li><li><b>3. Creative Contributors<br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br>We are always looking for filmmakers, photographers, and researchers who want to document the ongoing interventions. Help us create a digital archive of sites like the Mining Museum's Lapidarium to ensure our history does not crumble</b><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">.</b></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
