          "_name": "list05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list05\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Question\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ff8f7a\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#550000\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                <b>FAQ</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n            </h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>1. General Festival Information</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">•\tWhat is ZIFF? ZIFF is a sanctuary for \"engaged cinema\" and documentary realism, showcasing the pulse of a new generation of storytellers.\n<br>•\tWhen and where is ZIFF 2027? The festival is scheduled for June 2027 and will inhabit multiple authentic and inspiring cinema locations across Bucharest .\n<br>•\tWho leads the festival? ZIFF is a youth-led initiative founded by students and supported by professional mentors, including Johanna Croci, Theodor Aizic and Marc Paraschiv ensuring the project meets international standards of excellence.<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>2. Film Submissions &amp; Competition</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">•\tAre submissions open? Not yet. Please follow our Instagram and Newsletter for the official \"Call for Entries\" announcement.\n<br>•\tWhat are the categories? We currently feature three primary competitive categories: Short Fiction, Short Documentary, and Short Animated Film [105, Conversation History].\n<br>•\tCan I suggest a new category? Yes! We are still undergoing changes for the 2027 edition. If you have suggestions or themes you would like to see, please contact us directly.\n<br>•\tWhat are the eligibility requirements? Filmmakers must be at least 16 years of age. Films must have been produced between 2025 and 2027 and include hardcoded English subtitles if the original language is not English.<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>3. Donations &amp; The 50/50 Model</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">•\tWhere does my money go? ZIFF operates on a transparent 50/50 Investment Model.\n<br>o\t50% is reinvested into the festival to secure premier venues and elevate production standards.\n<br>o\t50% is channeled directly to our partners at the ARA Association to support professional heritage restoration in Roșia Montană.\n<br>•\tHow can I donate? You can provide one-time or monthly support through our Donate Page via Stripe, PayPal, or direct bank transfer to the ARA Association.<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>4. Heritage Collaboration (ARA Association)</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">•\tIs ZIFF part of \"Adopt a House\"? No. ZIFF is an independent entity that maintains a strategic collaboration with the ARA Association's \"Adopt a House\" program.\n<br>•\tHow does ZIFF support restoration? Beyond funding, we use the cinematic lens to advocate for the use of traditional crafts—such as lime-sand mortar and wooden shingles—to ensure the structural integrity and \"breathability\" of historical sites.<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>5. Ethics &amp; Reporting</b><b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">&nbsp;</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">•\tHow do you ensure fairness? All competition entries are reviewed by an independent professional Jury.\n<br>•\tHow can I report a concern? If you encounter unprofessional conduct or unfairness, please visit our Integrity &amp; Fairness page or email contact@zoomin-filmfest.com<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
