          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article07\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ff8f7a\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#550000\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>TERMS OF SERVICE: ZOOM IN! YOUTH SHORT FILM FESTIVAL</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Operated by: Seasidebranding (seasidebranding.com)<br><br>Website: zoomin-filmfest.com<br><br>Effective Date: July 10, 2026<br><br>Last Updated: July 10, 2026</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>1. Scope, Ownership, and Co-Operating Entities</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                  These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") constitute a legally binding agreement between Seasidebranding (\"the Company,\" \"we Cort,\" \"us\"), the users, student filmmakers, parents/legal guardians, and attendees accessing zoomin-filmfest.com (\"the Site\") or participating in the Zoom In! Youth Short Film Festival (\"the Festival\").<br>The Festival is a non-commercial, educational, and civic initiative originally created and coordinated by students of the International British School of Bucharest (IBSB). Physical events and screenings are hosted in collaboration with local theatrical partners, specifically Cinema Europa (Bucharest, Romania). These Terms govern all past participation in the February 2026 festival cycle, ongoing archival access, use of the Site, and any subsequent event iterations.<br>All or a portion of the team submission fees and event proceeds generated through the platform are directly allocated as charitable contributions to the \"Adoptă o Casă la Roșia Montană\" historic restoration program managed by Asociația Arhitectură. Restaurare. Arheologie (ARA). By utilizing the Site or participating in any capacity, you acknowledge this multi-entity operational framework.<br>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>2. Participant Eligibility &amp; The Minor Clause</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Because the Festival is tailored to youth filmmakers, the following strict age and consent standards apply to all accounts and submissions:<br><br>Age and Enrollment Requirement: Users and submitting filmmakers must be currently enrolled in a secondary school (high school) or be within the equivalent age bracket (typically 14–19 years old) at the time of submission.<br><br>Mandatory Parental/Guardian Consent: Because primary users and content creators are legally minors under Romanian and EU law, account registration and film submission are invalid without the co-signature or verified assent of a parent or legal guardian.<br><br>Verification Rights: The Company, IBSB coordinators, and Festival administrators reserve the right to request official proof of age, parental identity, or school enrollment at any time. Failure to provide sufficient verification within 48 hours of a formal request will result in immediate disqualification, content removal, and account termination.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>3. Registration, Submissions, and Civic Entry Fees</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">To enter a film into the competition or archive, participants must strictly fulfill the following criteria:<br><br>Account Generation: Users must maintain a profile using a verified, active email address belonging to either the student or their legal guardian.<br><br>The Talent Release &amp; Consent Form: Filmmakers must upload a signed (or securely e-signed) Zoom In Parental Consent &amp; Talent Release Form. Submissions missing this documentation are disqualified from screening and archival presentation.<br><br>Platform Routing: Films must be uploaded natively via the Site or through designated third-party submission architecture (e.g., FilmFreeway) as directed by the Company.<br><br>Civic Fee Allocation: You explicitly acknowledge that submission and registration fees serve a dual purpose as entry fees and direct donations toward the Adoptă o Casă la Roșia Montană building conservation project. Consequently, once a film has entered the selection process, these fees are non-extractable outside the explicit boundaries defined in Section 7.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>4. Content Guidelines, Rating, and Selection</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">As a youth-centric event hosted at a public venue (Cinema Europa), all artistic works must conform to community-safe and educational standards.<br><br>PG-13 Equivalence: All submitted short films must conform to a \"PG-13\" equivalent rating standard.<br><br>Prohibited Material: Submissions featuring excessive graphic violence, non-simulated illegal drug use, gratuitous profanity, hate speech, or sexually explicit content are strictly barred. The Company and the student-led selection committee retain sole, unreviewable discretion to disqualify any film or remove it from post-event archives.<br><br>Finality of Decisions: Screenings and awards are programmed by the selection committee and a jury of industry professionals. All selection, screening, and award decisions are final and binding.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><p><b>5. Intellectual Property Rights &amp; Licensing</b></p></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Filmmaker Ownership: The student filmmaker (and/or their school production team) retains 100% of the baseline copyright and intellectual property rights to their original film.<br><br>Promotional and Screening License: By completing a submission, the filmmaker and their signing guardian grant the Company, IBSB, and the Festival a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free, perpetual, sub-licensable license to:<br><br>Exhibition: Screen the short film publicly during official festival timelines at Cinema Europa and via any official digital or streaming mirrors hosted by the Company.<br><br>Marketing &amp; Archiving: Utilize clips (up to 30 seconds or 10% of total running time) and production stills in the Company’s portfolio, retrospective showreels, social media assets, historical archives, and marketing press releases aimed at promoting the Festival and its partner initiatives.<br><br>Music and Third-Party Clearances: The submitter is entirely responsible for securing synchronization licenses, master rights, and intellectual property clearances for all music, imagery, sound effects, and scripts used within the film. The Company and its partners are completely indemnified against copyright strikes, DMCA notices, or legal claims resulting from unlicensed media.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>6. Physical Event Attendance &amp; Venue Rules (Cinema Europa)</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">For physical events, screenings, and Q&amp;A sessions taking place in Bucharest:<br><br>Code of Conduct: All attendees, including student filmmakers, parents, and general audiences, must adhere to the venue rules established by Cinema Europa. Disruptive behavior, vandalism, or harassment will result in immediate expulsion from the premises without a refund.<br><br>Media Capture: By attending official physical festival events, attendees grant the Company and its authorized photographers the right to film, photograph, and record their likeness for archival, editorial, and promotional use.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>7. EU Right of Withdrawal &amp; Refund Limitations</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">In compliance with EU Directive 2011/83/EU on Consumer Rights, users residing within the European Economic Area possess specific consumer protections:<br><br>The 14-Day Cooling-Off Window: Users may request a full refund of entry fees or digital ticket purchases within 14 days of the initial transaction.<br><br>Express Exceptions: The right of withdrawal is voided, and no refunds will be issued, if any of the following occur before the expiration of the 14-day window:<br><br>The physical festival event has already commenced or took place (including the concluded February 2026 sessions at Cinema Europa).<br><br>The submitted film has already entered active review or judging by the selection committee.<br><br>The user has accessed, downloaded, or utilized \"Early Bird\" digital assets, educational guides, or premium platform features included in the fee structure.<br><br>Execution Process: To formally trigger an eligible refund request, email finance@seasidebranding.com with your original order number, proof of purchase, and submission details.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>9. Limitation of Liability</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\"As-Is\" Service: The digital platform, submission infrastructure, and archival portals are provided on an \"as-is\" and \"as-available\" basis without warranties of any kind.<br><br>Technical Exclusions: The Company is not legally or financially liable for server outages, corruption or loss of high-definition video files, missed submission deadlines due to internet failure, or third-party platform glitches (e.g., FilmFreeway outages).<br><br>Physical Event Indemnification: To the maximum extent permitted under Romanian law, the Company, IBSB, Cinema Europa, and its NGO partners are not liable for any personal injury, property damage, financial loss, or theft occurring to participants or audiences while traveling to, or attending events inside, the host venue.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>10. Governing Law and Jurisdiction</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">These Terms, along with all associated submission contracts and release forms, are exclusively governed by, construed, and enforced in accordance with the laws of Romania. Any legal actions, disputes, or claims arising out of or relating to the Festival, the Site, or transactions with Seasidebranding shall be settled strictly within the competent courts of Bucharest, Romania.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
