          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article07\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ff8f7a\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#550000\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>PRIVACY POLICY: ZOOM IN! YOUTH SHORT FILM FESTIVAL</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Operated by: Seasidebranding (seasidebranding.com)<br><br>Website: zoomin-filmfest.com<br><br>Effective Date: July 10, 2026<br><br>Last Updated: July 10, 2026<br><br>This Privacy Policy describes how Seasidebranding (\"the Company,\" \"we,\" \"us\") collects, uses, processes, and protects the personal data of users, student filmmakers, and parents or legal guardians interacting with zoomin-filmfest.com (\"the Site\") and the Zoom In! Youth Short Film Festival (\"the Festival\").<br><br>We operate in strict compliance with the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the applicable data protection laws of Romania. Because our platform primarily serves minor students, we enforce enhanced data protection safeguards.<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>1. Data Controller and Contact Information</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">The primary data controller for the personal data collected through the Site is:<br><br>Entity: Seasidebranding<br><br>Website: seasidebranding.com<br><br>Privacy &amp; Data Requests Support: support@seasidebranding.com<br><br>Financial/Billing Inquiries: finance@seasidebranding.com<br><br>Co-operating entities including the International British School of Bucharest (IBSB) student coordinating committee, Cinema Europa, and Asociația Arhitectură. Restaurare. Arheologie (ARA) act as authorized data recipients or joint controllers for specific operational purposes detailed in Section 5</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>2. Special Protections for Minors (Under 18)</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">The Festival is designed for secondary school students typically aged 14–19. Under Romanian law and Article 8 of the GDPR, processing the data of a child under 16 requires parental consent. To ensure absolute compliance:<br><br>Mandatory Consent: No account registration or film submission by a minor is considered valid until a parent or legal guardian has co-signed the Zoom In Parental Consent &amp; Talent Release Form.<br><br>Verification: We reserve the right to contact parents or legal guardians directly to verify consent. If we discover we have collected personal data from a minor without verifiable parental consent, that data will be permanently deleted immediately.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>3. Personal Data We CollecT</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">We only collect personal data that is strictly necessary to run the Festival, manage submissions, process charitable fees, and maintain our digital archives.<br><br>A. Information Provided Directly by You:<br>Account Registration Data: Full name, email address, password, age, and current secondary school affiliation of the student filmmaker.<br><br>Parent/Guardian Information: Full name, email address, and phone number of the parent or legal guardian co-signing the submission.<br><br>Submission Content: The short film file or link, film loglines, synopsis, cast/crew credits, and production stills.<br><br>Legal Documentation: Signed copies of the Zoom In Parental Consent &amp; Talent Release Form, which may include physical or digital signatures of both the student and the guardian.<br><br>Payment and Billing Data: When paying submission or ticket fees (allocated to Adoptă o Casă la Roșia Montană), our third-party payment processors collect credit card details, billing addresses, and transaction histories. We do not store raw financial data on our servers.<br><br>B. Information Collected Automatically:<br>Technical Data: IP addresses, browser type, operating system, referring URLs, and interaction data detailing how you navigate the Site. This information is collected via necessary cookies to ensure secure platform operation.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>4. Legal Basis for Processing Personal Data</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Under the GDPR, we process your personal data based on the following legal frameworks:<br><br>Performance of a Contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR): To fulfill our obligations under the Terms of Service, including managing your account, reviewing film submissions, and organizing festival programming.<br><br>Explicit Consent (Art. 6(1)(a) and Art. 9 GDPR): Granted by the parent/guardian via the signed Consent &amp; Talent Release Form for public exhibition, promotional use of film clips, and processing minor data.<br><br>Legitimate Interests (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR): To secure our platform, protect against fraudulent submissions, maintain historical/archival records of the February 2026 festival cycle, and improve future event structures.<br><br>Compliance with Legal Obligations (Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR): To maintain financial records of entry fees and donations for tax, accounting, and anti-money laundering regulations in Romania.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>5. How We Share and Disclose Data</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">We do not sell, rent, or trade personal data, particularly minor data, to third-party commercial advertisers. Data is shared exclusively with the following entities for operational purposes:<br><br>IBSB Student Organizing Committee &amp; Jury Members: Authorized student coordinators and professional film jurors access submission names, school details, and film content solely to judge, select, and program the festival.<br><br>Asociația ARA (\"Adoptă o Casă la Roșia Montană\"): Transaction and donor records may be shared to confirm the proper allocation of submission fees toward the historic restoration program.<br><br>Cinema Europa (Venue Partner): Aggregate or programmatic data may be shared for physical event coordination, capacity management, and security.<br><br>Technical Service Providers: Secure cloud hosting platforms, video streaming infrastructure, and payment gateways (e.g., Stripe, PayPal) that operate under strict data processing agreements (DPAs) conforming to GDPR standards.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>6. Data Retention Policy</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">We retain personal data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy:<br><br>Account &amp; Submission Data: Retained for archival, retrospective presentation, and portfolio promotion of the February 2026 cycle.<br><br>Unselected Submissions: Personal data and video files associated with entries not selected for the festival are deleted or anonymized within six (6) months following the conclusion of the festival cycle, unless explicit consent is given to maintain them in an archive.<br><br>Financial Records: Billing and donation transaction data are retained for a minimum of five (5) to ten (10) years to comply with Romanian fiscal and statutory accounting legislation.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>7. Data Security</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">We implement robust technical and organizational security controls to safeguard personal data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. These measures include SSL/TLS encryption for data transmission, restricted access protocols for administrative personnel, and regular security patching of the zoomin-filmfest.com platform infrastructure.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>8. Your GDPR Rights</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">As an EU resident, you (and your parent/guardian on your behalf if you are a minor) possess the following statutory rights regarding your personal data:<br><br>Right of Access: Request a copy of all personal data we hold about you.<br><br>Right to Rectification: Request the correction of inaccurate or incomplete personal data.<br><br>Right to Erasure (\"Right to be Forgotten\"): Request the permanent deletion of your personal data from our systems, subject to legal retention obligations (e.g., financial records).<br><br>Right to Restrict Processing: Request that we limit how we process your data under specific conditions.<br><br>Right to Data Portability: Request the transfer of your data to another controller in a structured, commonly used, machine-readable format.<br><br>Right to Object: Object to the processing of your data based on legitimate interests.<br><br>Right to Withdraw Consent: Withdraw your consent at any time for processing activities that rely on explicit consent (e.g., promotional licensing). Withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of processing based on consent prior to its withdrawal.<br><br>To exercise any of these rights, submit a formal request to support@seasidebranding.com. We will respond to all verified requests within thirty (30) days.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>9. Right to Lodge a Complaint</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">If you believe that our processing of your personal data infringes upon GDPR regulations, you have the right to lodge an official complaint with the Romanian supervisory authority:<br><br>Autoritatea Naţională de Supraveghere a Prelucrării Datelor cu Caracter Personal (ANSPDCP)<br><br>B-dul G-ral. Gheorghe Magheru 28-30, Sector 1, cod poștal 010336, Bucharest, Romania<br><br>Website: dataprotection.ro</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>10. Updates to This Privacy Policy</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">We may modify this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect shifts in regulatory frameworks, platform updates, or operational changes across co-operating entities. Any revisions will be signaled by updating the \"Last Updated\" date at the top of this document. Continued use of the Site after updates constitute acknowledgment of the revised policy terms.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
